          "message": "[cmd/mdatagen] Add status::class value internal (#16377)\n\n<!--Ex. Fixing a bug - Describe the bug and how this fixes the issue.\nEx. Adding a feature - Explain what this achieves.-->\n#### Description\n\nAdded new `status:class` for `internal` packages that require their\ncomponent IDs properly represented.\n\n<!-- Issue number if applicable -->\n#### Link to tracking issue\nFixes #16313\n\n<!--Describe what testing was performed and which tests were added.-->\n#### Testing\nAdded unit tests for metadata parsing and status validation\n\n<!--Authorship attestation. See AGENTS.md for details. AI agents must\nnot check this box on behalf\nof the user; the human author must check it themselves before the PR is\nready for review.-->\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n<!--Please delete paragraphs that you did not use before submitting.-->\n\nCo-authored-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
