          "id": "572057cde7e9bbe3aed6e5e3e8f16290d487f7d0",
          "message": "[cmd/builder] additional validation on input (#16402)\n\n#### Description\n\nThis updates the validation to enforce the following:\n\n- A module name must be a Go identifier.\n- import and the path part of gomod must be valid import paths.\n- dist.module must be a valid module path.\n- dist.name can't contain control characters, which is what stops a\nnewline from escaping the header comment.\n- replaces, excludes and module path can't span lines.\n- validateTelemetry runs the same per-module check.\n\n\n#### Testing\n\nTests added\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
