          "id": "645cec2cc1853098b282a5249be6602263a22cde",
          "message": "[exporter/otlp] add limits for upstream responses (#16415)\n\n#### Description\n\nThis adds a limit for a max number of headers parsed and max partial\nsuccess details logged from the upstream responses. This could be made\nconfigurable, but figured we could cross that bridge when we get there.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
