          "id": "b53a4721056b414ca408776bc0e72100e2abacf7",
          "message": "Log whether the Collector runs in FIPS 140-3 mode at startup (#16347)\n\n#### Description\n\nAdds a FIPS140 field to the \"Starting ...\" log line with the value of\n`crypto/fips140.Enabled()`.\n\n<!-- Issue number if applicable -->\n#### Link to tracking issue\nFixes #16346\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Israel Blancas <iblancasa@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
