          "distinct": false,
          "id": "584ff6ee070c957bc3043f2649b85fcdd1c8be5a",
          "message": "[cmd/builder] Fix strict versioning checks documentation (#16403)\n\n#### Description\n\nUpdates the \"Strict versioning checks\" section in\n`cmd/builder/README.md` to fix two inaccuracies:\n1. Removes reference to the removed `dist::otelcol_version`\nconfiguration field and clarifies that the check compares against the\ncore collector version built into the builder (`ocb`) itself.\n2. Corrects the documented default behavior of\n`--skip-strict-versioning` to reflect that strict checks are disabled by\ndefault (`--skip-strict-versioning` defaults to `true`), and explains\nthat passing `--skip-strict-versioning=false` enables them.\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\n\nFixes #16365\n\n#### Testing\n\nDocumentation-only change. Verified markdown rendering and whitespace\nformatting.\n\n#### Documentation\n\nUpdated `cmd/builder/README.md` under the \"Strict versioning checks\"\nsection.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\nSigned-off-by: Yash Verma <yashraj.dns@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-16T19:46:36Z",
