          "id": "0c7dae72b5b6e543fbb0b93ac95a7ff97e5f5d93",
          "message": "Add SanitizeUTF8 to OTLP ExportRequest types to replace invalid UTF-8 with U+FFFD (#16072)\n\n#### Description\n\nFirst of two PRs for the sanitization mode agreed in #11449. This adds\nonly the pdata piece. The OTLP receiver feature gate that calls it comes\nin a follow-up so the API review and the receiver behavior stay\nseparate.\n\n`SanitizeUTF8()` on the `ExportRequest` types in `plogotlp`,\n`ptraceotlp`, `pmetricotlp` and `pprofileotlp` replaces every run of\ninvalid UTF-8 bytes in the string fields of the request with `U+FFFD`.\n\n<!-- Issue number if applicable -->\n#### Link to tracking issue\nUpdates #11449\n\n<!--Describe what testing was performed and which tests were added.-->\n#### Testing\n- Added unit tests\n\n<!--Authorship attestation. See AGENTS.md for details. AI agents must\nnot check this box on behalf\nof the user; the human author must check it themselves before the PR is\nready for review.-->\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\nSigned-off-by: Israel Blancas <iblancasa@gmail.com>",
