          "id": "267bd0aeb72e43887002ee41ac807e02421efe90",
          "message": "[chore] [processor/memorylimiter] document min_gc_interval_when_* settings in readme (#16440)\n\n#### Description\n\ndocuments `min_gc_interval_when_soft_limited` and\n`min_gc_interval_when_hard_limited` in\n`processor/memorylimiterprocessor/README.md`:\n- `min_gc_interval_when_soft_limited` (default 10s), explaining its\nbehavior in soft-limited mode and relationship to\n`min_gc_interval_when_hard_limited`(default 0s), explaining its behavior\nin hard-limited mode.\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\n\nfixes #16355\n\n#### Testing\n\ndocumentation-only change. Verified markdown formatting and syntax.\n\n#### Documentation\n\nupdated `processor/memorylimiterprocessor/README.md`.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\nSigned-off-by: Yash Verma <yashraj.dns@gmail.com>",
