          "id": "c9d6bea25b5999a2f7898fb804f15fedd93dc7f1",
          "message": "[config/configtls] update fields to opaque (#16435)\n\n#### Description\n\nThe tpm auth config fields should have always been marked as opaque so\nthey are redacted.\n\n**Note for reviewers**: configtls is stable, so this is technically\nchanging the field type on the struct which changes the API. The end\nuser's experience stays the same. I think this is an OK change as it\ndoes fix a bug, but please voice any concerns you have.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
