          "id": "0156e7b68d6e0b450dd416deda0589205866fe9f",
          "message": "[chore] [exporter/otlphttp] Fix logs and profiles endpoint override notes (#16439)\n\n#### Description\n\nfixes the per-signal endpoint override notes in\n`exporter/otlphttpexporter/README.md`:\n- added the missing note under `logs_endpoint` explaining that\n`endpoint` is ignored for logs when configured.\n- corrected the note under `profiles_endpoint` to state that `endpoint`\nis ignored for profiles.\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\n\nfixes #16354\n\n#### Testing\n\nDocumentation-only change. Verified markdown formatting and rendered\nsyntax.\n\n#### Documentation\n\nupdated `exporter/otlphttpexporter/README.md`.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\nSigned-off-by: Yash Verma <yashraj.dns@gmail.com>",
